Inject

This repository contains an initial extraction of a cross-platform native input
injection layer for use as a standalone library.

The copied and adapted portions originate from Rein's src/server/drivers,
src/server/types.ts, and src/server/constants.ts on the main branch and remain
available under the Apache License 2.0.

The extraction intentionally excludes Rein-specific WebRTC/signalling,
InputHandler protocol processing, throttling/validation, UI gesture code, and
application-specific gamepad resources.
